  ],
  "qualification": "Current fast4 passes4204 units/411 files; focused6 constructor/destructor controls pass. Live source3 world/composition, normal and actual mixed HTTP exports, all six original native2 groups and depth10 pass on held inputs4. Both normal source3 MP4 bytes and all six actual mixed raw HTTP frame bodies match the preceding slice31 production render. This repair concerns application-visible owners: no physical driver RSS/internal PMREM failed-allocation bound is inferred from mocked failure controls. Existing world admission remains unchanged, with scope-specific current/peak/cleanup receipts. Prior installed archive remains exact b4fc65ed; new shared-world code is not relabeled as that archive. Aggregate parsed-source/world/body/replay admission, remaining MS2 criteria/full gates and final installed refresh remain.",
